OL,3,ADizzee Rascal spotted at community folk
OL,4,Afestival
OL,5,
OL,6,FMusic lovers were surprised by the
OL,7,F"unexpected" arrival of rapper Dizzee
OL,8,FRascal during a market town's folk
OL,9,Ffestival.
OL,11,FThey had been attending the BunkFest
OL,12,Fweekend in Wallingford, Oxfordshire, on
OL,13,FSunday, when the superstar was seen at
OL,14,FThe Boat House pub.
OL,16,FSeveral people rushed over to have
OL,17,Ftheir photos taken with the grime and
OL,18,Fhip hop artist, who has so far had five
OL,19,FUK number one singles, including
OL,20,FBonkers, Dance Wiv Me and Holiday.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
