OL,3,ADizzee Rascal spotted at community folk
OL,4,Afestival
OL,5,
OL,6,FFestival attendee Charlie Garwood, 23,
OL,7,Fsaid: "I love his songs. You don't
OL,8,Fexpect someone like that to be in a
OL,9,Flittle town like Wallingford."
